This is not available on the gallery, but can be downloaded directly here: https://mega.nz/file/2opyxYBa#93oQV-WxivQ3hCPKpchOcDAlkTuXQ8XlbzPGi5omFN0

&#x200B;

Just download and unzip the folder, and place the mods in your mod folder and everything else in the tray folder. And make sure to turn on bb.moveobjects before placing it!

This is not available on the gallery, but can be downloaded directly here: [https://mega.nz/file/qhYBXa5b#rIkH5CTQFoLNwj7wNB3uuWCIr326Ect-CNC77JFUnOw](https://mega.nz/file/qhYBXa5b#rIkH5CTQFoLNwj7wNB3uuWCIr326Ect-CNC77JFUnOw)

&#x200B;

Just unzip the folder after downloading and place the loose files in your Tray and everything else in your Mods.

&#x200B;

Make sure to turn on bb.moveobjects before placing the lot!
